1
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,160
大家没事吧
Is everybody ok?

2
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,020
我没事 谢谢你没丢下我
I'm fine. Thanks for waiting.

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:07,780
发生什么事了
What was that?

4
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:09,960
水管和煤气管爆炸的逃生方式都一样
Water either gas line, the training is the same.

5
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,560
大家弯腰前行 马上离开房子
People, just stay low and move out.

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,140
老公 卢克不见了
Honey, Luke's gone.

7
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,580
克莱尔 人体自燃十分少见
Claire, spontaneous human combustion is very rare.

8
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,500
我不觉得是他自爆了 菲尔
I don't think he exploded, Phil.

9
00:00:17,862 --> 00:00:21,353
绳梯很管用 至少有人是按逃生规程来的
The rope ladder works. At least someone followed protocol.

10
00:00:21,353 --> 00:00:22,560
是那个
Oh! Oh, it's there!

11
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,600
烟是从卢克该死的魔术箱里冒出来的
Smoke is coming out of Luke's stupid suitcase.

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,280
有其父必有其子 卢克也是个魔术师
Like his old man, Luke is a magician.

13
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:31,600
教我魔术的是我爸上网搜来的大师
I'm taking lessons from some guy my dad found online.

14
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,760
他可是有莫德斯托巫师大会
He came personally recommended from the guy who runs

15
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,280
举办者的个人推荐呢
The Warlock Conference up in Modesto.

16
00:01:08,079 --> 00:01:09,500
此位有人了 大块头
Ocupad, big guy.

17
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,680
请另寻良枝吧
Find another foxhole.

18
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:21,720
*大家跟我一起学唱歌*
*This is how we learn to sing*

19
00:01:22,220 --> 00:01:25,280
*谁来跟我一起唱*
*Who can go up here with me?*

20
00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:29,240
小卡要去本地中学当音乐老师了
Cam took a job teaching music at the local middle school.

21
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:30,760
明天就是上班第一天
Yeah, his first day is tomorrow.

22
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,580
我为自己开心
I'm excited for me,

23
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:34,800
但更为我的学生开心
but I'm probably more excited for the students

24
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,860
因为优秀的老师是天赐的礼物
because a great teacher is a gift.

25
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:37,960
还没正式上岗呢
Hasn't started yet.

26
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:40,520
我要向我的高中音乐老师致敬
I have to tip my hat to my high school music teacher...

27
00:01:40,740 --> 00:01:42,200
此人带有自然的魔力
A real force of nature

28
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,820
同时身兼橄榄球队的防守员
who was also the defensive coordinator for the football team

29
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:48,020
和农场动物俱乐部的牛犊接生监察员
and supervised calf birthing for the animal husbandry club.

30
00:01:48,180 --> 00:01:49,940
朵莉丝·奥尔森 一位伟大的女士
Doris Olson. Great lady.

31
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:51,980
好一位女士
Lady.

32
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:56,860
*大家跟我一起学唱歌*
*This is how... we learn to sing*

33
00:02:16,108 --> 00:02:18,480
杰 人家会想你的
Ay, Jay, I'm going to miss you.

34
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,180
只是一晚上而已
It's one night.

35
00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:21,120
不 人家不想和你分离
No, I don't want to be without you,

36
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,460
我这辈子一晚都不能离开你
not even one night in my whole life.

37
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,420
我能为你做点什么
What can I make you?

38
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,260
在床上给我腾点位置怎么样
How about a little room on my side of the bed?

39
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:30,680
我是不该抱怨 我老婆美艳动人 但是
I mean, I shouldn't complain. My wife's a knockout. But...

40
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,580
她现在处于孕期中的某个阶段
she's at that place in her pregnancy

41
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,840
她变得 臃肿
where, she's, you know... ample.

42
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:36,040
还打呼噜
And the snoring.

43
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:39,380
我发誓 上一张超音波片里婴儿是这样的
I swear in the last ultrasound, the baby was like this...

44
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:43,120
我明天中午就能到家
So I should be home about noon tomorrow.

45
00:02:43,130 --> 00:02:44,285
谁把咖啡都喝完了
Who drank all the coffee?

46
00:02:44,285 --> 00:02:46,460
我喝了不少
Oh, I, uh, I had quite a bit of that.

47
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:49,270
我最近晚上睡得不太好
You know, I haven't, um, been sleeping too well.

48
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:52,180
失眠的原因说来也挺好笑
There's actually a funny story about what's causing that.

49
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:55,720
妈 我非常理解您的身体正经历着变化
Mom, I'm fully aware of the changes your body is going through,

50
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:58,500
鼻塞也是怀孕时常见的现象
and that nasal stuffiness is very common during pregnancy,

51
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:00,180
但家里的情况已经刻不容缓了
but we got a crisis in this house.

52
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:02,680
你打呼太严重了 我帮你买了呼吸辅助贴
You've been snoring. But I got you these nasal strips.

53
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:03,600
广告里
In the commercial,

54
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:06,180
连老头如雷般的呼噜声也能化为轻柔之音
the old man's angry red sound waves turn a gentle blue.

55
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,760
-所以我打呼像老头子吗 -不是
- So I'm like an old man? - No!

56
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:10,820
那我是像狗 还是像猪
Like a dog then? A pig?

57
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:14,080
怎么 曼尼 我是老头子 还是狗或猪
What is it, Manny? I'm an old man, a dog, or a pig?

58
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,540
杰 帮我说两句 你也听到呼声了
Jay, help me out here. You've heard it.

59
00:03:16,580 --> 00:03:18,120
我完全不知道这孩子在说什么
I don't know what the boy's talking about.

60
00:03:18,140 --> 00:03:20,540
如果这是青春期的曼尼 我可不喜欢
If this is a glimpse of teenage Manny, I don't love it.

61
00:03:20,780 --> 00:03:22,500
你妈这么漂亮 你要尊重她
Have a little respect for your beautiful mother.

62
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:24,720
谢谢你 杰
Thank you, Jay.

63
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:27,900
你说得对 我错了 妈妈
You're right. Sorry, mom.

64
00:03:28,340 --> 00:03:29,060
杰
And, Jay,

65
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,800
祝你在旧金山玩得愉快
Have a great trip to San Francisco.

66
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:37,580
莉莉到校的时间是8点45到50之间
Okay, Lily's drop-off time is between 8:45 and 8:50,

67
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:39,820
所以你应该能来得及9点上班
so you should be fine to get work by 9.

68
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:42,420
这是她背包内容的清单
Here is her checklist for her backpack.

69
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:45,060
我一切都计划好了
Oh, I have this whole thing planned.

70
00:03:45,060 --> 00:03:46,249
我款款步入教室 脱下我的外套
Okay, I'm gonna walk in, take off my jacket,

71
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:47,900
大声宣布 高音号在此
and say, "Here comes treble."

72
00:03:47,900 --> 00:03:49,280
上班第一天扭得挺欢啊
Big swing on the first day.

73
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,100
请不要打击我的热情
Please don't tamp down my enthusiasm.

74
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:51,840
好了 还有什么
Okay, what else?

75
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,760
对了 调光器的开关有问题
Oh! The dimmer came in for the switch,

76
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,540
你去请个电工来 但是别找布拉德
so I want you to call the electrician, but not Brad.

77
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:57,440
还记得上次我们为账单和他不太愉快吗
Remember? We had a problem with him last time about the billing.

78
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,020
因为他想要名列账单[演员表]前茅
He wanted his name above the title?

79
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:01,240
你讲过这个笑话了 好可爱好好笑
Yes, you've done that joke before. So cute. So funny.

80
00:04:01,420 --> 00:04:01,960
还有什么 哦
What else? Oh!

81
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,280
莉莉需要为吉奥的生日派对准备礼物
Lily needs to get a present for Gio's birthday party.

82
00:04:04,420 --> 00:04:05,600
别被请帖迷惑了
And don't be thrown by the invitation.

83
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,496
是海盗主题派对 不是普拉提健身派对
It is a pirates party, not a pilates party.

84
00:04:07,496 --> 00:04:08,880
过来坐好 我再说说果汁盒的事
Now sit. I wanna talk juice boxes.

85
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:10,560
小卡 小卡 我知道你现在什么状况
Cam. Cam, I know what's happening here.

86
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,980
你第一天上班 感觉特别紧张
You're feeling very anxious about your first day at work,

87
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:15,880
然后你把焦虑转移到我带莉莉这件事身上
And you're focusing that anxiety on my day with Lily.

88
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:16,940
真的吗 你不觉得
Really? Are you sure I'm not

89
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:18,360
我对这第一天充满了信心吗
completely confident about my first day

90
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,320
人家肯定满分表现啦
because it's gonna be a home run.

91
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:21,000
而我担心你 是因为你的任务
And I am worried about you because you're taking on

92
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,100
可不只是照顾莉莉呢
a little bit more of the Lily load?

93
00:04:22,112 --> 00:04:24,480
别怕 亲爱的 么哇
Don't be scared, sweetie. Mwah!

94
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:26,540
她才不怕呢 你这是干嘛
She's not scared! What are you doing?

95
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,300
-需要我就打电话给我 -不会的
- Just call me if you need me. - I won't!

96
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:30,200
非常感谢你控制一下我的期望值
And thank you for managing my expectations today.

97
00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:30,960
但其实没必要
Not necessary.

98
00:04:31,180 --> 00:04:33,520
我昨晚看到你在练习鞠躬
I saw you practicing a bow last night.

99
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:34,580
练着玩儿而已
That was just in fun.

100
00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:36,800
我觉得那些孩子是不会
You know, I highly doubt some teenagers are gonna

101
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,360
往我脚边撒玫瑰花瓣的
throw rose petals at my feet.

102
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:41,180
但是我第一堂课结束后
But I wouldn't be surprised

103
00:04:41,180 --> 00:04:43,200
掌声蔓延不息什么的也不足为奇
if I got slow-clapped out of my first class.

104
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:45,340
错了
Wrong.

105
00:04:46,060 --> 00:04:47,000
我还在想呢
I am thinking.

106
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,100
如果你真的用脑在想
If you were thinking,

107
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:50,460
就不会把西雅图当成华盛顿州的首府了
you wouldn't have Seattle as the capital of Washington.

108
00:04:52,780 --> 00:04:53,420
是斯波坎
It's Spokane.

109
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:56,140
好吧 那美国的第11任总统就成了
Sure, which makes the 11th president of the United States

110
00:04:56,140 --> 00:04:57,380
詹姆斯·波斯克
"James k. Pslk."

111
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:58,320
好了 艾丽克斯 别这样
Okay, Alex, stop.

112
00:04:58,340 --> 00:04:59,660
我正在想呢
I'm trying to figure this out.

113
00:05:00,780 --> 00:05:02,200
哔哔 时间到 笨蛋 是奥林匹亚
Buzz. Time's up, dummy. It's Olympia.

114
00:05:03,420 --> 00:05:05,400
记得在表演时喊出那吓死人的行话哦
Make sure you sound out the big scary words.

115
00:05:09,180 --> 00:05:11,920
妈妈 有件事让我很苦恼
Mom, something's on my mind, and it's really bothering me.

116
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:13,940
对啊 也让我很苦恼
Yeah, it's really bothering me, too,

117
00:05:13,952 --> 00:05:15,280
但我觉得她以后可能是个女富豪
But I think it's gonna be rich,

118
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,520
所以我们要对她好一点
so we better be nice to it.

119
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,285
我不想再学魔术了
I wanna quit magic.

120
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:18,680
什么
What?

121
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:21,100
我真的没什么兴趣了
I'm not really interested anymore,

122
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,880
但我想爸爸会不高兴的
but I don't think dad's gonna be happy.

123
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,700
宝贝 别担心让你爸爸失望
Oh, sweetheart. Don't worry about disappointing your father.

124
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,960
他只会希望你去做你真正喜欢的事
He only wants you to do it if you wanna do it.

125
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:29,240
不如这样吧 我跟你爸谈谈
Tell you what. I will talk to dad--

126
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:32,700
哇 跟老爸谈谈 一本正经的样子
Whoa! Talk to dad? That sounds serious.

127
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,520
不许嗑药
Don't do drugs.

128
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,800
不要逃学
Stay in school.

129
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:37,760
卢克不想再学魔术了
Luke wants to quit magic.

130
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:38,560
绝对不行
That's not happening.

131
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,380
晚上见吧
Well, see you guys at dinner.

132
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:42,760
亲爱的 你完全不想谈谈这事儿吗
Sweetheart, don't you even want to talk about this?

133
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,520
有什么好谈的 我儿子天生就是这块料
What's to talk about? The kid's a natural.

134
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,280
他天赋异禀
He has everything--

135
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:46,980
双手灵活 行话精通 装备齐全
the hands, the patter, the outfits.

136
00:05:46,980 --> 00:05:48,160
好吧 我们设想一下
Okay, let's play this out.

137
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:50,400
即使他是万里挑一的好苗子
Even if he is one in a million,

138
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,940
最好的结果又如何
what's our best case scenario here?

139
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,000
他会变成什么
He becomes, what...

140
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,580
一个专业的魔术师
A professional magician!

141
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:57,120
亲爱的 这孩子就是有这天赋
Honey, the boy has a gift.

142
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,660
你想白白浪费这天赋吗
You wanna just throw that away?

143
00:05:58,660 --> 00:06:00,220
那才不是什么白白浪费
I don't think it's about throwing it away.

144
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:00,861
而是你逼着他
I think it's about you pushing him--

145
00:06:00,861 --> 00:06:02,560
我能插两句话吗
Don't I get a say in any of this?

146
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,420
很遗憾我不像你那么喜欢魔术
I'm sorry I don't like magic as much as you,

147
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:05,000
但我真不喜欢
but I don't.

148
00:06:05,060 --> 00:06:06,080
这与魔术无关
This isn't about magic.

149
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:08,440
确实 而是我的人生你做主
No, it's about my life and you controlling it.

150
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,940
听着 你许下承诺 就该信守承诺
Look, you made a commitment. You will honor that commitment.

151
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:12,480
我最讨厌这个
Ugh! I hate it here!

152
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:15,600
卢克
Luke!

153
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:24,140
好了 年轻的女士们先生们
All right, young ladies and gentlemen,

154
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,200
请听我说 好吗
if I can have your attention, please.

155
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:27,160
大家坐坐好
Let's settle down

156
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:29,720
跟邻座的同学和无趣的生活
and let's say a temporary good-bye to your neighbor

157
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:32,600
暂时告个别 因为时代男高音来了
and to life as you know it, because here comes treble.

158
00:06:32,746 --> 00:06:35,127
没错 下面的朋友们 时代最高音
That's right, my friends, we got treble,

159
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:36,460
就在弗兰克林中学
Right here at Franklin middle.

160
00:06:36,828 --> 00:06:38,740
我是卡梅隆小T 韵脚是个小G
I'm Cameron T., and that rhymes with "G,"

161
00:06:38,740 --> 00:06:39,960
意思就是"古德猫林"[早上好]
And that stands for "Good morning"!

162
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,960
请说 就爱有热情的
Huh? Yes! Love the enthusiasm.

163
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:44,240
说吧 第一个问题
Go ahead. First question.

164
00:06:44,540 --> 00:06:46,120
纳玛奇老师什么时候回来
When's Mr. Namagachi coming back?

165
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,800
纳玛奇老师不会再回来了
Okay, Mr. Namagachi isn't coming back,

166
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:51,860
但我想向你们介绍一个人
But there is somebody that I'd like to introduce you to.

167
00:06:52,489 --> 00:06:54,040
不知道你们是否正式见过面了
Don't know that you proy met.

168
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,760
她是我的好朋友
She's a good friend of mine,

169
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:58,220
她的名字就叫作 "音乐"
and she goes by the name of "Music."

170
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:04,100
有时候我的朋友音乐很羞涩
And sometimes my friend music can be shy.

171
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:09,140
有时候则充满了愤怒
Sometimes she can be angry!

172
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,080
有时候又很欢腾
Sometimes she can be playful.

173
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:19,860
有时候则是非常 时髦[放克乐]
And sometimes she can be downright a-funky!

174
00:07:22,620 --> 00:07:23,700
大事不妙
Train wreck.

175
00:07:23,712 --> 00:07:26,101
他肯定没跟米奇尔商量过要用这招
There's no way he ran this past Mitchell.

176
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:29,440
大爸通常停在学校的后门
Daddy always parks in the back of the school.

177
00:07:29,447 --> 00:07:30,557
我知道 宝贝 但是
I know, sweetie, but, uh,

178
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,020
那里的停车位都被占了
those spots were all taken.

179
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:34,080
因为我们迟到了
Because we're late?

180
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:36,120
不是 我们才晚了一分钟 是因为堵车
No, we're, like, a minute late, and that's 'cause of traffic.

181
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:38,360
也因为我摔倒了
And because I tipped over.

182
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:40,720
你没系好我的安全座椅
You didn't snap my car seat right.

183
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:42,380
好吧 那一摔倒是没把你的记忆摔坏嘛
Okay, well, it certainly didn't hurt your memory any.

184
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:43,620
给你午餐
All right, here's your lunch.

185
00:07:45,100 --> 00:07:46,360
你弄洒了
You spilled it!

186
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:48,200
盖子怎么开着呢
Oh! Why is the top open?

187
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:50,520
大爸都会替我拉上拉链的
Daddy always zips it for me.

188
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:51,640
或许你该自己拉上
Maybe you should zip it.

189
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:53,980
我可听到你的吐槽了
I heard that.

190
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:56,080
既然还剩几分钟时间
So with just a few more minutes left--

191
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:57,940
-纳玛奇老师 -以前在这里工作
- Mr. Namagachi-- - used to work here,

192
00:07:57,940 --> 00:07:59,320
可他被开除了 明白吗
but he got fired, okay?

193
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,020
那么 现在 让我们用
So now let's form an orchestra

194
00:08:01,020 --> 00:08:02,460
我最喜欢的乐器组成乐队吧
made up of my favorite instruments--

195
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:03,960
也就是你们美丽的身体
your beautiful bodies.

196
00:08:03,971 --> 00:08:04,893
有点"变态"了
Gettin' creepy.

197
00:08:04,893 --> 00:08:08,180
那么 你们负责拍桌子打节拍
Okay, so you guys are gonna be my, uh, table slappers.

198
00:08:08,180 --> 00:08:08,900
你们是我的低音部
You're my bass line.

199
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:12,100
而后面这些同学就用嘴模仿小号的旋律
Okay, and you're gonna be mouth trumpeters in the back with the melody.

200
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:16,100
好的 现在 大家一起来
Okay, now let's bring it all together.

201
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:17,360
一 二 三
One, two, three.

202
00:08:19,598 --> 00:08:21,805
低音部声音再柔和一点
The bass line is a little-- a little softer.

203
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:24,033
模仿小号的声音再大一些
Okay, louder with the mouth trumpets.

204
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:27,360
好极了 非常感谢你们
Okay. Great. Well, thank you so much.

205
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:29,343
我觉得今天棒极了
And, um, I thought it was a great first day.

206
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:31,189
各位同学 我喜欢与你们互相学习
And I love the give-and-take, everyone.

207
00:08:31,189 --> 00:08:32,264
还有
And, um...

208
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:40,520
老爸 "西斯科"好玩吗
Hey, dad. How's Frisco?

209
00:08:40,820 --> 00:08:42,140
我的会议早结束了
My meetings ended early.

210
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,640
我都不用在那儿过夜
I didn't even have to spend the night.

211
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,740
你也别再说"西斯科"了
And don't say "Frisco."

212
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:46,580
他们不喜欢别人把那里叫做"西斯科"
They hate it when you call it "Frisco."

213
00:08:46,780 --> 00:08:47,560
你怎么知道
How do you know what they hate?

214
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:48,780
你这辈子只去过那里两次
You've been there two times in your life.

215
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:50,640
爱咋咋地 我都一星期没睡觉了
Anyway, I haven't slept in a week.

216
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:53,280
歌洛莉亚打呼噜打得跟水牛似的
Gloria's snoring like a water buffalo.

217
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:56,452
她在怀孕嘛 肯定不舒服
Aw. Well, she's pregnant. It's uncomfortable.

218
00:08:56,732 --> 00:08:59,800
她增肥了多少 15 20 25 30磅吗
What, she put on 15? 20? 25? 30?

219
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:02,880
别老问这个了 我要怎么跟她提这件事呢
We're not doing this again. How do I bring it up?

220
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:05,180
首先 你不要提
Well, for starters, you don't.

221
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:06,500
老实忍着吧
You suck it up.

222
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:08,400
老爸 你的辣妻
Dad, your hot wife

223
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,820
她刚学走路时 你已经是而立之年了
who was learning to walk when you were 30 years old,

224
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:12,720
现在她怀了你的娃
is pregnant with a baby you conceived

225
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:15,400
多少男人拼了命想跟她造个娃啊
doing something most men would kill to do.

226
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:19,000
-我就是太累了 -那点小牺牲
- I'm just so tired. - It's a small sacrifice

227
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:21,560
跟她所遭受的相比不值一提 小可怜
compared to what she's going through. Poor thing,

228
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,180
她增肥了多少磅 30 35 40 45
what with the extra... 30? 35? 40? 45?

229
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:24,560
够了
We're done.

230
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,720
好的 开始喽 这个怎么样
All right, here we go. How's this?

231
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,100
我们不买这种
That's not the kind we get.

232
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:28,660
好吧
Okay.

233
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,580
喂 你好 小卡
Hello? Hey, Cam.

234
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:34,280
又打电话查岗吗
Just checking in on me again?

235
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,260
是的 就想看看你有没有接到莉莉
Yeah. Just wanted to see if you got Lily.

236
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:38,008
接到了 我们刚到 我们在杂货店
Yeah, we're--we're just-- we're at the grocery store,

237
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:39,200
正逛得高兴呢
having a great time.

238
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:44,820
是吗 关于购物清单...
Oh. Yeah. Any questions about the...

239
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:45,800
有什么问题吗
about the grocery list?

240
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,480
没有 我们正在买格兰诺拉燕麦片
No, we're just picking up the granola.

241
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:49,600
你怎么样 你的初次登场如何
So how was it? How was the big debut?

242
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:51,860
在学校里是不是和孩子们
Was it a comfortable ride around the schoolyard

243
00:09:51,860 --> 00:09:53,020
相处融洽 如鱼得水
on the shoulders of the children?

244
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,260
我反正是为人师表了一回
Well, I stood and delivered.

245
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:55,700
谢谢你冷嘲热讽的询问
Thank you for sarcastically asking.

246
00:09:55,700 --> 00:09:56,420
可以
Yeah.

247
00:09:58,160 --> 00:10:00,000
你有没有给电工打电话说调光器的事
Okay, did you call the electrician about the dimmer?

248
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,300
打了 当然打了
Yes. Yeah.

249
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:02,960
他现在正在另一条线上等待通话呢
Yeah, I'm on the other line with him right now.

250
00:10:03,217 --> 00:10:04,500
好了 那我大概应该撂电话了
Oh, well, I should probably let you go.

251
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:06,580
看好莉莉 她特爱乱跑
Keep your eye on Lily. She has a tendency to wander off.

252
00:10:06,580 --> 00:10:09,594
小卡 我 我当然能...
Cam... Uh, wh-wh--I'm-- I'm totally capable of...

253
00:10:09,594 --> 00:10:11,700
-你把她弄丢了 是不是 -没有没有
- You lost her, didn't you? - No. No, no, no, no.

254
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:14,420
没有 她就在我旁边 嗨 宝贝
No, she is right next to me. Hi, honey.

255
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:16,560
我能听出来什么情况 到乳制品柜里找找
I can hear it in your voice. Look in the dairy case.

256
00:10:16,700 --> 00:10:19,400
小卡 你不会真以为我能弄丢...
Cam, do you honestly think that I would lose...

257
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,950
那门拉不开 是滑开的
the doors don't pull. They slide.

258
00:10:31,140 --> 00:10:34,020
就当你没见到过我
You never saw me.

259
00:10:39,780 --> 00:10:42,780
非常感谢
Thank you very much.

260
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,340
我想了想
Look, um, I thought about it,

261
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,740
要是你特别想告别魔术 那就随你意
and if you really want to, you can quit magic.

262
00:10:59,620 --> 00:11:01,340
只要 你最后做一件事
You just have to do one thing first--

263
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,600
表演"巴特勒逃脱术"
execute the Butler's escape.

264
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:07,300
毫无疑问 巴特勒逃脱术
It goes without saying that the Butler's escape

265
00:11:07,300 --> 00:11:09,720
是逃脱术中最具挑战性的特技
is one of the most challenging feats of escapology

266
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,240
是魔术师最高等级的表演之一
an illusionist can perform.

267
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,660
此魔术 正是基于 那著名的
It's--it's based, of course, on the well-known story

268
00:11:13,660 --> 00:11:15,500
弗兰宁伯爵的男仆珀西的故事
of the Earl of Flanning's manservant Percy,

269
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,180
珀西被囚禁在伦敦塔里
who was imprisoned in the Tower of London,

270
00:11:17,180 --> 00:11:20,000
众所周知 在被铐上枷锁的时候
and as we all know, refused to take off his uniform

271
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:20,820
他坚决不脱自己的制服
when he was shackled.

272
00:11:21,371 --> 00:11:24,700
大家都知道 塔上的侍卫格特睡着后
Famously, as the, uh, tower guard Gert slept,

273
00:11:24,700 --> 00:11:27,320
珀西挣脱了枷锁 悄悄跃过睡着的侍卫
Percy freed himself and leapt over the sleeping guard,

274
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:31,520
那句著名的俗语就从此而来...
giving rise to the popular expression...

275
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:33,600
"珀西跃过格尔特"
"Percy jumped the Gert."

276
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:37,380
你为什么要我做这个愚蠢的把戏
Why are you making me do this stupid trick?

277
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,360
我觉得你之所以不想学了
I think you're quitting...

278
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,840
是因为魔术难度越来越大
because magic's getting hard,

279
00:11:39,860 --> 00:11:41,820
但在任何事上 都不该因惧怕困难而退缩
and that's not a good reason for quitting anything.

280
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:42,760
但是...
But...

281
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,700
如果你能成功
if you can do this,

282
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:46,980
我就知道你是真心不喜欢魔术
then I'll know that you genuinely don't like it,

283
00:11:46,980 --> 00:11:48,900
就算你从事其他爱好 我也祝福你
and you'll have my blessing to pursue other interests.

284
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:51,780
不带附加条件
No strings attached.

285
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,760
抱歉 小老弟
Sorry, buddy.

286
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,920
真抱歉
I'm so sorry.

287
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,460
你在开玩笑吧
You're kidding, right?

288
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:58,740
你不会真的喜欢这种三俗剧吧
You cannot really be enjoying that stupid show.

289
00:11:58,780 --> 00:12:00,000
我只不过是换台时停顿了一下
I was changing channels.

290
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,860
天呐 你最近怎么这么刻薄呢
God. Why are you so mean lately?

291
00:12:02,019 --> 00:12:03,259
你遇到什么事了吗
Is something wrong with you?

292
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:05,380
有这么明显吗
Is it that obvious?

293
00:12:05,380 --> 00:12:07,381
天呐 快来 跟我说说
Oh, my gosh. Come on. You can talk to me.

294
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:13,580
我学校里有个女同学 她...
There's this girl at school, and...

295
00:12:13,580 --> 00:12:14,140
她怀孕了
She got pregnant.

296
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:15,520
不是吧
No.

297
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:17,180
是啊 我一直试着帮她
I know. I've been trying to help her,

298
00:12:17,180 --> 00:12:19,340
但由于药物作用 她听不进劝
But with all the pills she's taking, she kinda lashes out.

299
00:12:19,420 --> 00:12:21,680
宝贝 你一人面对这样的事太不容易了
Oh, honey, this is too much for you to take on alone.

300
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,580
-她的家长呢 -他们帮不上忙
- Where are the parents? - They're no help.

301
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:25,680
她爸爸一心只顾着自己的整容生意
Dad's all consumed with his plastic surgery business,

302
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:28,880
妈妈以前是模特 正努力发展音乐事业
and her mom's an ex-model who's trying to launch a music career.

303
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:30,520
这是我刚刚看的电视剧里的剧情吧
You're describing the show I was just watching, right?

304
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,848
我只是想说 时不时读点书吧
I'm just saying, mix in a book every now and then.

305
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:34,140
刻薄 刻薄鬼
Mean! Mean!

306
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,480
试着从我的角度看看
Try to see this from my perspective.

307
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:37,480
我看不了
I can't.

308
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,240
我的儿子不能半途而废
I'm not raising a quitter.

309
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,980
相信我 我知道什么对你有好处
Trust me. I know what's best for you.

310
00:12:42,443 --> 00:12:44,040
注意控制时间 舞台表演时
And watch your time. In the stage version,

311
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:46,420
绳子会被点燃 而你会被悬在钉板上
the rope's on fire, and you're suspended over a bed of nails.

312
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:48,640
我讨厌这把戏 你为什么逼我做这个
I hate this! Why are you making me do this?

313
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,940
化愤怒为力量 卢吉尼
Use that anger, Lukini.

314
00:12:50,940 --> 00:12:53,940
将它变为打开恐惧之门的钥匙
Let it be the key that opens the vault of fear...

315
00:12:54,530 --> 00:12:56,780
那里面有希望之杯
that holds the chalice of hope

316
00:12:57,200 --> 00:13:00,140
杯里盛着成功的灵丹妙药
that contains the elixir of success.

317
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:02,640
短短几分钟后...
In a few short minutes...

318
00:13:04,477 --> 00:13:06,939
我的神啊 你成功了
Son of Alkazeel! You've done it!

319
00:13:07,020 --> 00:13:07,840
我不干了
I quit.

320
00:13:12,860 --> 00:13:15,240
第一天怎么样 快跟我说说
So how was your first day? Tell me everything.

321
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:17,400
你懂的 我备受喜爱
Well, you know, it was a lovefest.

322
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:19,600
孩子们 他们 你知道吧...
And the kids-- they were, you know, and...

323
00:13:21,540 --> 00:13:22,220
那是烤肉吗
Is that a roast?

324
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:25,340
是的 我很惊讶你居然可以闻出来
W--yes. Yes. But I'm surprised you could smell it over the

325
00:13:25,340 --> 00:13:27,840
毕竟有黄胡椒浓汤 配油煎干酪面包块的混合
no-dairy yellow pepper bisque with cheesy croutons.

326
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:30,020
哇 你还能腾出时间烤肉又煲汤
Oh, wow. You had time to do a roast and soup.

327
00:13:30,020 --> 00:13:32,160
-爹地好 -你好 我的天使
- Hi, daddy! - Hi, angel!

328
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:33,880
你好吗 有没有想爸爸
How are you? Did you miss daddy?

329
00:13:34,052 --> 00:13:36,700
哇 洗了澡还梳好了辫子
Wow. Bathed and braided.

330
00:13:36,700 --> 00:13:39,140
是啊 我来把灯光调得柔和些
Yeah. Let me just put you in a more flattering light here.

331
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:40,360
调光器
The dimmer.

332
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,640
你叫谁来修的
Who'd you call?

333
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:43,669
我叫了我自己 我修的
I called myself 'cause I did it.

334
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:47,060
对 买完给吉奥的礼物后我还有些时间
Yeah, I had time after picking up Gio's present,

335
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:49,020
所以就...把礼物拿来给爸爸看看
so, uh... Go show daddy what it is.

336
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:50,160
-好 -乖
- Okay. - Yeah.

337
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:53,440
听起来你这一天过得充实又高效
It sounds like you had a pretty successful day yourself.

338
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:55,440
只是有条理些罢了
Well, it's just a matter of being organized.

339
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,620
但我这是班门弄斧呀
But who am I telling, huh?

340
00:13:56,620 --> 00:13:58,300
你每天都是这么高效
You do this sort of stuff every day.

341
00:13:58,620 --> 00:13:59,420
吹一下
Oh, blow on that.

342
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:01,960
再跟我说说孩子们的事吧
So tell me more about the kids.

343
00:14:02,180 --> 00:14:04,120
就和我想象的一样
Well, it was as I predicted, you know.

344
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,700
他们需要的是个
They just needed somebody to come in there

345
00:14:05,700 --> 00:14:07,740
能让音乐恢复生机的老师
and bring music back to life.

346
00:14:07,740 --> 00:14:09,520
而且 那个人就是...
And, you know, that person was...

347
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,520
那个人就是...
that person was...

348
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,460
不是我
It's not me!

349
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:14,300
出什么事了
What's happening?

350
00:14:14,420 --> 00:14:15,760
糟糕透了 米奇尔
It was a disaster, Mitchell.

351
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,260
他们讨厌我
They hated me!

352
00:14:17,380 --> 00:14:18,920
不只是孩子们 老师们也是
Not just the kids, the teachers.

353
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,260
午饭时他们都不和我一起坐
They wouldn't sit with me at lunch.

354
00:14:20,340 --> 00:14:21,180
我只得自己一个人吃
I had to sit alone.

355
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:22,160
亲爱的不哭
Oh, honey.

356
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:24,940
还有我的运动衫 手工老师把橘汁洒上面了
And my sweater--the shop teacher spilled juice on it.

357
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:27,180
他说是不小心的 但我知道他是故意的
He said it was an accident, but it wasn't an accident.

358
00:14:27,300 --> 00:14:29,180
-没关系的 -怎么会没关系
- It's okay - It's not okay!

359
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:30,760
我全搞砸了
I failed miserably.

360
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:33,240
你看你 你把所有的事都做的井井有条
And look at you. You did everything so perfectly.

361
00:14:33,500 --> 00:14:34,900
那倒是
Well, yes.

362
00:14:35,972 --> 00:14:37,136
也不是
And--and--and no.

363
00:14:37,136 --> 00:14:39,106
其实...实话跟你说吧
Look, look, I... I gotta tell ya.

364
00:14:40,700 --> 00:14:42,260
我一直用心观察
Uh... I've just been watching

365
00:14:42,260 --> 00:14:43,540
多年来你做事情的方法
how you've done things all these years,

366
00:14:43,540 --> 00:14:44,800
然后我稍加完善了一下
and I just perfected it.

367
00:14:45,075 --> 00:14:46,717
-拜托 米奇尔 -克莱尔...
- Oh, please, Mitchell! - Claire...

368
00:14:46,798 --> 00:14:49,000
小卡 他跟你一样失败得一塌糊涂
Cam, he was every bit the failure you are.

369
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:52,100
他没按时接莉莉 她只好被保育员看管
He was late picking up Lily. She was in with the custodians.

370
00:14:52,180 --> 00:14:53,780
晚饭也不是他做的 更离谱的是
The only thing he had less to do with than dinner

371
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:55,200
调光器他压根就没碰
was the dimmer.

372
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:58,460
莉莉漂亮的小辫 是他用口香糖粘的
And her hair was in braids because there was gum in it.

373
00:14:58,460 --> 00:15:00,520
另外...你们为什么抱抱
And... why are we hugging?

374
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:02,500
因为我知道如果他求你帮忙
Because I know if he called you for help

375
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:04,960
一定忍受了许多讽刺和辱骂
and heard as many insults as I know he had to hear,

376
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,321
那么他这天过得比我还糟
then he had a worse day than me.

377
00:15:06,321 --> 00:15:08,010
她好可怕 小卡
Oh, she was horrible, Cam.

378
00:15:08,540 --> 00:15:10,600
-没事的 一切都会好的 -不 我知道
- You know what? It's gonna get better. - No, I know.

379
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,500
我们只是需要时间来适应我们的新角色
We just need some time to settle into these new roles.

380
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:14,080
你让我降低期望值真是太对了
You were right to lower my expectations.

381
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,600
应该降低期望值的是我
I just wish I had lowered mine.

382
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:20,160
你们不打算跟我道个谢吗 女士们
This gonna work its way around to a "Thank you," Ladies?

383
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:30,600
嘿 宝贝
Hey, honey.

384
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:32,760
惊喜吧 我到旧金山了
Surprise! I'm in San Francisco!

385
00:15:33,060 --> 00:15:33,400
什么
What?

386
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:36,349
我把曼尼放朋友家了 我知道这很疯狂
I dropped Manny at a friend's and, I know it's crazy,

387
00:15:36,349 --> 00:15:38,380
但我赶上了一班飞机就飞来啦
but I hopped on a plane and I'm here!

388
00:15:38,380 --> 00:15:39,380
现在正往酒店去
I'm driving to the hotel.

389
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:40,860
那太棒了
That is so great.

390
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:43,880
可是宝贝 我现不在酒店里
The thing is, honey, I'm not here right now.

391
00:15:44,052 --> 00:15:46,105
我正在外面吃晚饭
See, I'm, uh, I'm out at dinner.

392
00:15:46,641 --> 00:15:48,512
暂时赶不回来
Probably won't be back for, um...

393
00:15:49,332 --> 00:15:50,940
可能得几个小时吧
Oh, I don't know. A couple of hours.

394
00:15:50,940 --> 00:15:52,400
没关系 人家等着你
It's okay. I'll wait for you there.

395
00:15:52,900 --> 00:15:55,560
别傻了 多难得来一趟旧金山啊
Don't be silly. How often do you get to san francisco?

396
00:15:55,780 --> 00:15:57,400
那里有很多地方可以参观
There's so much to see there.

397
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:59,280
我是说"这里"
I mean, here.

398
00:16:00,192 --> 00:16:02,189
吉拉德里广场 渔人码头
Ghirardelli square? Fisherman's wharf?

399
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:04,420
恶魔岛也不错 对了 去报个赛格威团吧
Alcatraz? Hey, take that segway tour.

400
00:16:04,620 --> 00:16:05,860
可以饱览城市美景
That's a great way to see the city.

401
00:16:05,870 --> 00:16:06,794
喝海鲜杂烩浓汤时
And when you get the chowder,

402
00:16:06,794 --> 00:16:08,661
一定要用"面包碗"
Make sure it one of those bread bowls.

403
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:10,000
喝完汤可以把碗吃了
You can eat the bowl.

404
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:12,420
对了 你以后都可以拿这事儿当美谈了
Yeah, it's a story you'll tell for a lifetime.

405
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:20,020
话说 待会儿
You know what? Later on...

406
00:16:20,020 --> 00:16:22,360
我们可以看一些兰斯·伯顿的光碟
Maybe we can watch some of your Lance Burton DVDs.

407
00:16:22,370 --> 00:16:24,879
谢谢 我就是想尝试一下逃脱术
Thanks. I think I just wanna try this escape.

408
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:26,920
能帮我把手臂这儿弄紧点吗
Would you mind tightening my arms?

409
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,079
当然 来
Oh. Sure. Here.

410
00:16:28,940 --> 00:16:30,360
我心里挺不好受的
It's just hard, you know?

411
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:33,240
他这是第一次对我的爱好不感兴趣
It's the first time he hasn't shared one of my interests.

412
00:16:33,540 --> 00:16:36,280
我们父子要是从此有隔阂了可怎么办
It's scary to think that this is the start of us growing apart.

413
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:38,840
亲爱的 没准这只是暂时的
Oh, honey, it's probably just a phase.

414
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:40,220
倒是艾丽克斯最近有点儿不正常
Alex is going through something right now.

415
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:41,460
我要是能搞明白她的问题就好了
I wish I could figure that out.

416
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:43,460
-我喘不过气了 -焦虑啊
- I can't breathe. - Anxiety.

417
00:16:43,460 --> 00:16:45,580
不不 我在努力挣脱枷锁衫
No, no, I'm--I'm fighting the jacket.

418
00:16:45,580 --> 00:16:46,980
逃脱的关键就是要受力平衡
The key to this escape is balance.

419
00:16:47,060 --> 00:16:49,820
反作用力是整个逃脱术的突破点
The whole thing is based on the idea of opposing forces.

420
00:16:49,820 --> 00:16:51,740
控制两边的力量
Holding each other in check.

421
00:16:52,211 --> 00:16:53,605
说得有点道理
That actually makes some sense.

422
00:16:55,460 --> 00:16:56,500
有"点"道理
Some sense?

423
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:59,480
世上有两件事是我百分百确定的
There are two things I know with dead certainty--

424
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,020
一是如何挣脱开叠罗汉
How to shoulder roll out of a human pyramid,

425
00:17:02,020 --> 00:17:04,080
二是破解"巴特勒逃脱术"
and the black arts of the Butler's escape.

426
00:17:04,280 --> 00:17:06,660
不 亲爱的 我们家失去平衡了
No, honey, our house is out of balance,

427
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:09,520
因为艾丽克斯失去"反向作用力"了
because Alex is missing her opposing force.

428
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:10,725
对吧 我好聪明
Mm? Yeah.

429
00:17:10,929 --> 00:17:12,703
你错失了大好机会
Oh. Y-you're missing out.

430
00:17:12,940 --> 00:17:15,300
有人说此魔术是场视觉盛宴
Some people describe this escape as visual poetry.

431
00:17:18,688 --> 00:17:19,743
亲爱的
Honey?

432
00:17:26,860 --> 00:17:27,660
完了
oh, no.

433
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:29,840
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

434
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:33,280
你说你在西斯科
You told me that you were in Frisco,

435
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:34,660
但却在酒店被我抓了个正着
and you were here in a hotel?

436
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:36,120
我就说一点
Let me just say one thing.

437
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:37,540
别说"西斯科" 当地人不爱听
Don't say "Frisco." They hate that.

438
00:17:37,800 --> 00:17:39,680
你怎么找到我的
And how the hell did you find me?

439
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:41,680
家里最近有点小噪音
The house has been a little noisy lately.

440
00:17:41,718 --> 00:17:43,427
学校图书馆又像个勾搭妹子的炮点
And the school library is a pickup scene.

441
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:45,420
一个渴望安静祥和的孩子能去哪儿呢
So where does a kid go for some peace and quiet?

442
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:58,180
告诉我你是不是有外遇了
Tell me right now if you're having an affair,

443
00:17:58,180 --> 00:18:01,060
待会儿我再找时间抽死你
and we will find some time later for me to kill you.

444
00:18:01,060 --> 00:18:03,940
不是的 我只是想远离你的鼾声一晚
No. I'm just trying to have one night away from your snoring.

445
00:18:05,064 --> 00:18:06,560
你来酒店开房是为了睡觉
You came to a hotel to sleep?

446
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:09,240
我精疲力尽了 我不想说出来让你难过
I'm exhausted, and I didn't want to hurt your feelings,

447
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:11,100
但你身躯庞大而且又吵
but you're huge and you're loud.

448
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:12,720
我就好像和拉什·林博同床一样
It's like sleeping with Rush Limbaugh.

449
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,800
我不想说这事 是因为我觉得
And I didn't want to bring it up because I figured

450
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:16,620
你会像生曼尼的气那样 生我的气
you'd get mad at me the way you got mad at Manny.

451
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:19,580
我生气不是因为你说我打鼾
I am not mad at you because you told me that I snore.

452
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:22,140
我生气是因为你什么也没说
I am mad at you because you didn't say anything.

453
00:18:22,140 --> 00:18:23,580
因为我不想被你骂
'cause I didn't want to get yelled at.

454
00:18:23,580 --> 00:18:24,680
太遗憾了
Well, too bad.

455
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:26,060
你娶了我
When you're married to me,

456
00:18:26,060 --> 00:18:28,520
就得准备好被骂个够
you're going to get yelled at many times.

457
00:18:28,969 --> 00:18:30,796
而且你坚强到完全可以接受
And you're tough enough to take it.

458
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:33,120
我就是喜欢咱们婚姻的这点
That's what I love about our marriage.

459
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:34,880
我们可以畅所欲言
We can say whatever we want,

460
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,960
但说完以后 谁也不会放在心中
but the next day, we're still there.

461
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,500
我也喜欢这点
That's what I like about it, too.

462
00:18:39,248 --> 00:18:41,600
看来我说什么你都能原谅我啊
What am I gonna say you couldn't forgive me?

463
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:42,800
也有不可原谅的 杰
There are things, Jay.

464
00:18:43,300 --> 00:18:43,960
可以走了吗
You ready to go?

465
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:46,900
我在想 开了房不用
I was thinking, it's such a shame

466
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:49,440
实在是太可惜了
that this hotel room is going to go to waste.

467
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:51,620
我喜欢这事的发展方向
I like where this is headed.

468
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:55,160
给曼尼做点意面 我们明早见了
Make Manny some pasta. I'll see you tomorrow morning, okay?

469
00:18:59,420 --> 00:19:00,300
嘿 爸
Hey, dad.

470
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:01,200
嘿 小老弟
Hey, buddy.

471
00:19:02,292 --> 00:19:04,600
听我说 我很抱歉我...
Look, I-I'm sorry if I--

472
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:06,480
别这样 不用道歉
No no no, don't apologize.

473
00:19:07,300 --> 00:19:09,060
我们可以一起做很多其他事
There's still plenty of stuff we can do together.

474
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:11,200
所以如果你想退出
So if you want out,

475
00:19:11,740 --> 00:19:12,840
你就退"出"吧
you are... Out!

476
00:19:16,241 --> 00:19:18,420
我知道我们买了很多魔术用具
Uh, I know we bought a lot of magic stuff,

477
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:20,320
但是可以退回去一些
but we can return some of it--

478
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:24,020
巫师帽 手套 大部分的披风
Merlin's hat, the gloves, most of the capes.

479
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,420
魔术大师手杖呢
What about houdini's wands?

480
00:19:26,888 --> 00:19:28,434
弄断了
They kinda got broken.

481
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:29,600
三支全断了吗 怎么了
All three? What happened?

482
00:19:29,620 --> 00:19:30,760
我买的是碳纤维材质的
I got you carbon fiber.

483
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:32,980
在学校有些同学拿来开玩笑
Some kids were messing around with them at school.

484
00:19:33,010 --> 00:19:35,081
什么意思 他们做了什么
What do you mean? What--what were they doing?

485
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:38,620
我真心不想说这事儿
I don't really want to talk about it.

486
00:19:40,260 --> 00:19:42,200
这种事我也经历过
You know, I went through that,

487
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,280
同学们拿我的东西开玩笑
kids--kids messing with my stuff.

488
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:46,880
-真的吗 -对 高中时
- Really? - Oh, yeah. In high school,

489
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:49,140
我第一次提名参加低年级翻筋斗大赛
When I first got nominated for junior tumbling congress,

490
00:19:49,900 --> 00:19:52,200
我父母要签同意书[释放]
my parents had to sign a... release!

491
00:19:55,753 --> 00:19:58,486
总之 我哥们儿晕乎布雷迪
Anyway, my buddy dizzy Brindizzi

492
00:19:58,700 --> 00:20:02,120
看到了 抢过去 猛开我的玩笑
saw it, grabbed it, and made a lot of fun of me.

493
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,960
我就想着不去了
I thought about not going.

494
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:05,140
但你去了
But you did.

495
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:07,420
是啊 可爽了
Oh, yeah. Had a blast.

496
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:08,780
交了很多朋友
Made a lot of friends,

497
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:12,040
与不止一位女筋斗运动员分享奶昔
shared milkshakes with more than one female tumbler.

498
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,720
我不再在乎其他人想法
The minute I stopped caring what other people thought

499
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:16,940
开始做自己想做的事情那一刻 就是
and started doing what I wanted to do, is the minute

500
00:20:16,940 --> 00:20:19,420
我终于感觉到"自由"的那一刻
I finally felt... Free!

501
00:20:27,220 --> 00:20:27,740
小老弟
Buddy...

502
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:29,040
你自己做决定吧
You're gonna make your own choices,

503
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:32,520
无论你的决定是什么 我永远会支持你
and whatever you decide, I'll always support you.

504
00:20:32,860 --> 00:20:34,980
你说这些不是因为你脱不了身 有求于我吧
You're not just saying all this 'cause you're stuck, right?

505
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:38,320
你做的任何决定都不会令我失望
Nothing you decide will ever disappoint me.

506
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:40,060
多谢了 爸
Thanks, dad.

507
00:20:41,940 --> 00:20:43,120
胳膊放松
Relax your arms,

508
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:44,940
肩膀朝前
roll your shoulders forward,

509
00:20:45,380 --> 00:20:46,260
低下头
bend down your head,

510
00:20:47,140 --> 00:20:47,180
呼气
exhale...

511
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:48,240
然后拱背
And then arch.

512
00:20:51,807 --> 00:20:53,139
还算管用
Uh... It sorta worked.

513
00:21:01,940 --> 00:21:04,600
宝贝 我只是想看看你问个好
Well, honey, I just wanted to check in and say hi.

514
00:21:04,660 --> 00:21:06,560
艾丽克斯 过来跟你姐打个招呼
Alex, come say hi to your sister!

515
00:21:06,820 --> 00:21:08,060
我好爱你
I love you so much.

516
00:21:08,060 --> 00:21:09,460
咋滴了 小姐
What's up, lady?

517
00:21:09,620 --> 00:21:12,240
我的天 你怎么能说"咋滴了 小姐"
Oh, my god. You did not just say, "What's up, lady?"

518
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:13,300
你什么毛病啊
What's wrong with you?

519
00:21:13,360 --> 00:21:14,600
我只是问好
I was just saying hello--

520
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:16,380
那是你说过的最白痴的话
Oh, it's like the lamest thing you've ever said.

521
00:21:16,380 --> 00:21:17,160
你这衣服算什么
And what is that shirt?

522
00:21:17,220 --> 00:21:18,160
你是20年代的摩登女郎吗
What are you, a flapper?

523
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,418
我买的那家店可是你...
I just bought it at that store that you--

524
00:21:19,418 --> 00:21:21,480
哪家店 "永远的1921"吗
Oh, where? Forever 1921?

525
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,980
而且你头发是怎么回事
And what is going on with your hair?

526
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,380
我的头发又怎么了
What's wrong with my hair?

527
00:21:24,380 --> 00:21:26,620
你干脆把自己在"驱男剂"里蘸蘸好了
Oh, you should just dip yourself in boy repellent.

528
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:27,960
闭嘴 妈
Shut up! Mom!

529
00:21:28,180 --> 00:21:29,360
平衡
And balance...

530
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:30,640
恢复了
is restored.
